      "id": "node-core-hub",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ⚙️ DazeStack Bulk Plugin Manager Architecture\n- **Entry Point:** `bulk-plugin-manager.php`\n- **Controller:** `DSBPM_Admin` & `DSBPM_AJAX`\n- **Design Language:** Mac-style Frosted Glassmorphism\n- **Security:** AES-256 Credentials, SSRF Mitigation, Nonces",
