    },
    {
      "id": "node-installer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🛡️ Installer & Rollback Guard\n- **Class:** `DSBPM_Installer`\n- **Skin:** `DSBPM_Upgrader_Skin` (Silent feedback)\n- **Sandbox:** `try...catch (\\Throwable $e)`\n- **Automatic Rollback:** Auto-deactivate crashing plugin & capture trace without breaking WP Admin.",
