      "text": "### 📚 Recipes & WP-CLI Generator\n- **Class:** `DSBPM_Recipes`\n- **Pre-built Playbooks:** WooCommerce, Performance, Security, SEO\n- **Persistence:** Custom user stacks stored in WP options (`dsbpm_recipes`)\n- **WP-CLI Output:** `wp plugin install <slugs> --activate`",
