      "text": "### 🧠 Universal AI Mesh Engine\n- **Config:** `ai-mesh.json` (Vault: `~/.config/antigravity/ai_mesh.env`)\n- **Tier 0:** Local Apple Silicon UMA / Gemma 4 ($0.00)\n- **Tier 1:** NVIDIA NIM Kimi-K3 1M Context & Vision\n- **Tier 2:** Claude Haiku 5.5 (541 tok/s) & Mercury 3\n- **Tier 3:** Cross-Project Domain Engines (AshWebsite, SolarQna)",
